+ * IOSurfaceClientRelease calls trap 4 under its cache lock and trap 5 after it, for ONE
+ * release (Topaz 0135/0136). Releasing at both dropped two references per release and
+ * unmapped surfaces another IOSurface object of the task still used. Trap 4 now only
